- Run [tests/telegram_tester/tester.py](file:///C:/Users/aabda/OneDrive/Desktop/DA%20Project/tests/telegram_tester/tester.py) with specific queries:
    - "Mark the last email as read" -> Verify the PATCH request in logs.
